MODULE: QueueOwnershipCancellationKeepsQueueEntry
TARGET: QueueOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: actual cold lifetime cancellation leaves its old semaphore waiter registered

--- FIND
CancelQueued(r) ==
    /\ status[r] = "queued" /\ r \in cancelled
    /\ queue' = Remove(queue, r) /\ status' = [status EXCEPT ![r] = "idle"]
--- REPLACE
CancelQueued(r) ==
    /\ status[r] = "queued" /\ r \in cancelled
    /\ queue' = queue /\ status' = [status EXCEPT ![r] = "idle"]
--- END
